units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
timestep 0.001
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
mass 1 58.6934
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes dist gaussian
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal
thermo 1000
fix ensemble all npt temp 300 2500 100 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1000
run 220000
unfix ensemble
